{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1443","id":4008897239,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87u8urX","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1443","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1443.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1443.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1443","number":1443,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(method-map): all-3530 post-attempt review payload read model (#1431)","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nBuilds the all-row **PostAttemptReviewPayload** read model over the governed 9709 **3530-row** universe from checked-in artifacts only. Reuses the #1430 candidate MS-review adapter payloads and the #1429 schema validator; no cie-762 dependency.\n\n`scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-review-payload-all-3530.mjs` iterates the 3530 governed question rows (from the #1408 runtime read model, loaded via the adapter), reuses candidate payloads where present, and synthesizes schema-valid `fallback_explanation`/`unavailable` payloads for the rest. Every payload is validated with `validatePostAttemptReviewPayload`.\n\n## Exact counts (validator: `pass`)\n\n- `total_post_attempt_review_payload_row_count`: **3530**\n- `missing_post_attempt_review_payload_row_count`: **0**\n- `unique_question_row_count`: **3530**\n- `valid_payload_row_count`: **3530** / `invalid_payload_row_count`: **0**\n- `candidate_backed_row_count`: **47** (grouped by `question_key` from **50** candidate links)\n- `candidate_link_count`: **50** / `adapter_candidate_count`: **50**\n- `fallback_row_count`: **3483**\n- `authoritative_score_allowed_count`: **0** / `point_judgement_allowed_count`: **0**\n- `official_ms_image_student_display_allowed_count`: **0**\n\n## Invariants enforced (13 validator checks, all pass)\n\n- `primary_display_mode` never `source_image_only` / `source_image_primary` (nor any source-image mode)\n- source/official screenshot student display false for candidate/unreviewed/quality/rights-blocked assets\n- `payload_student_display_allowed` does not imply `official_ms_image_student_display_allowed`\n- no authoritative scoring or point judgement without an explicit released scoring authority\n- checked-in artifacts only — no production Supabase/RAG/vector/frontend integration\n\n## Artifacts\n\n- `post-attempt-review-payload-all-3530-read-model.v1.json`\n- `post-attempt-review-payload-all-3530.manifest.v1.json`\n- `post-attempt-review-payload-all-3530.validator-result.v1.json`\n- `post-attempt-review-payload-all-3530.readback.md`\n\n## Tests\n\n`scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-review-payload-all-3530.test.js` — 5 focused tests (counts/invariants, candidate-drop failure, row-drop failure, unauthorized-scoring failure, deterministic artifact writes). Focused suite + siblings (adapter/schema/question-runtime all-3530) = 29 tests pass. ESLint clean; report/artifact index guard passes.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","